---
source: crates/trawl-cli/src/trial/render.rs
expression: "text(|out| render_inventory(out, &inventory, Path::new(\"/state/trawl/trial\")))"
---
`trawl trial down` deletes these Docker resources:

  container trawl-trial-postgres-1  running
  network   trawl-trial_default
  volume    trawl-trial_postgres
  container trawl-trial-claim       created

and the trial directory, with its state and token files:

  /state/trawl/trial
